Two things to settle before this goes out. I made 3 small fixes.

Questions
  Clause 1: Should this be 30 or 13? The term reads "thirty (13) months".
  Clause 4: 4 or 5 business days? Clause 4 says 4, clause 9 says 5.

Changes (tracked in the attached redline)
  1. "Reciever" is misspelled
  2. Section 7 should be Clause 7
  3. Apostrophe in "its'"

Points for you
  A. The confidentiality obligation has no time limit
  B. The indemnity is uncapped

Reply "30; 4; clean copy" for a clean copy with your answers in,
"undo 1" to reverse a change, or "B is fine" to dismiss a point.
Reply "renumber" and I'll fix the numbering and every reference to it.
Say "sig pages" when it is ready to sign. Reply "stop" to end this
conversation, or "help" to see what I can do.

